WEBVTT

01:40.300 --> 01:42.970
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.530 --> 01:45.850
[Episode 4]

01:47.950 --> 01:51.100
-Please!
-That corrupt official brought no rice!

01:51.560 --> 01:52.820
You corrupt official!

01:56.400 --> 01:57.660
Protect His Lordship!

01:59.039 --> 01:59.870
Catch him!

02:00.200 --> 02:01.400
Let me go!

02:06.870 --> 02:08.800
I know you've suffered a lot.

02:09.520 --> 02:12.120
I also know this world is unfair to you.

02:12.750 --> 02:13.840
Trust me.

02:15.280 --> 02:16.150
I will

02:17.430 --> 02:18.630
definitely help you.

02:32.520 --> 02:33.320
You're awake.

02:34.079 --> 02:35.210
How am I still alive?

02:38.030 --> 02:38.960
His Lordship

02:39.190 --> 02:41.150
is the top interrogator
in the Criminal Justice Office.

02:41.150 --> 02:42.610
If he didn't want you dead,

02:43.079 --> 02:45.520
he wouldn't miss by half an inch.

02:46.120 --> 02:47.720
Now drink your chicken soup.

02:48.400 --> 02:50.430
It's made with premium ginseng
and silkie chicken.

02:50.430 --> 02:52.190
With just a few superficial wounds
like yours,

02:52.190 --> 02:54.250
2 or 3 months' rest and you'll be fine.

02:56.079 --> 02:57.210
I'm not drinking it.

02:57.680 --> 03:00.540
There are still many people
who have nothing to eat.

03:06.000 --> 03:07.240
Before His Lordship came here,

03:07.240 --> 03:08.960
he swore an oath to His Majesty

03:09.280 --> 03:10.430
that from this day forth,

03:10.430 --> 03:13.360
there will be no more
corrupt officials in Hengtang.

03:14.310 --> 03:15.370
Now that he's here,

03:15.710 --> 03:17.310
those who gave you stale rice

03:17.710 --> 03:19.310
and left you starving

03:19.750 --> 03:21.710
will surely pay

03:21.800 --> 03:23.130
for what they have done.

03:24.470 --> 03:25.190
So,

03:26.280 --> 03:27.560
just keep the money,

03:28.310 --> 03:29.510
focus on recovering,

03:29.870 --> 03:31.280
and wait for the news.

03:32.110 --> 03:34.120
Leave the rest to us.

03:37.710 --> 03:38.840
Now drink your soup.

03:44.360 --> 03:45.870
I can do my part, too.

03:47.190 --> 03:49.650
[Zuixian Tavern]

03:57.030 --> 04:00.120
I've invited you all here today

04:00.560 --> 04:03.960
to ask for a favor, to be honest.

04:04.960 --> 04:07.120
Help me collect grain.

04:09.280 --> 04:11.800
At 3 times the market price.

04:13.080 --> 04:15.610
I hope I can count on your support,
gentlemen.

04:16.070 --> 04:16.720
Money

04:17.269 --> 04:18.950
will certainly not be an issue.

04:18.950 --> 04:21.750
This will allow me to
answer to the imperial court.

04:22.680 --> 04:24.040
I see.

04:24.270 --> 04:25.330
I'll be counting on

04:25.390 --> 04:28.240
your guidance in the days ahead, Lord Wei.

04:29.310 --> 04:30.040
Lord Yan,

04:30.310 --> 04:32.190
you're too kind.

04:32.310 --> 04:35.120
We're the ones who'll be counting on you.

04:35.510 --> 04:36.159
Right?

04:36.270 --> 04:37.730
-Yes, yes.
-That's right.

04:38.070 --> 04:38.720
Alright,

04:39.040 --> 04:40.120
enough shop talk.

04:40.830 --> 04:42.480
Let's begin.

05:07.310 --> 05:08.070
Come on.

05:08.070 --> 05:10.560
To Lord Yan. To Lord Yan.

05:16.360 --> 05:17.600
-Fire!
-Fire!

05:17.600 --> 05:19.070
-Put out the fire!
-Put out the fire!

05:19.070 --> 05:20.190
Fire!

05:20.390 --> 05:21.310
Put it out!

05:32.040 --> 05:34.120
To Lord Yan. To Lord Yan.

05:34.120 --> 05:34.680
Come on.

05:37.800 --> 05:38.430
Oh no!

05:38.720 --> 05:39.430
Help!

05:39.430 --> 05:40.430
Where's the fire?

05:40.800 --> 05:42.600
It seems to be the Xie Residence.

05:44.310 --> 05:45.560
Go help put out the fire!

05:45.560 --> 05:46.480
-Yes. Got it.
-Go. Hurry.

05:46.480 --> 05:47.810
I'll take my leave then.

05:47.920 --> 05:48.680
Follow me!

05:48.870 --> 05:50.070
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

05:52.800 --> 05:53.560
Fan Zhong.

05:54.310 --> 05:55.040
Follow them.

05:55.120 --> 05:55.800
Yes.

05:58.909 --> 06:01.490
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

06:00.190 --> 06:01.390
Lord Yan,

06:01.600 --> 06:02.600
I've long heard of

06:02.750 --> 06:04.210
your remarkable bearing.

06:04.510 --> 06:05.720
Seeing you today,

06:06.630 --> 06:08.090
I see the rumors were true.

06:09.600 --> 06:11.060
Old Madam, you flatter me.

06:11.870 --> 06:13.680
I came here today because

06:13.830 --> 06:16.230
I heard there was a fire
at your residence.

06:17.160 --> 06:18.120
I wanted to see

06:18.430 --> 06:19.480
if there was anything I could do

06:19.480 --> 06:21.240
to help.

06:24.720 --> 06:26.050
It was only a small fire.

06:26.310 --> 06:27.630
Hardly worth troubling you over,

06:27.630 --> 06:29.510
Lord Yan.

06:34.750 --> 06:35.390
By the way,

06:35.950 --> 06:37.950
I heard Lord Xie has taken ill,

06:38.390 --> 06:40.480
and His Majesty has allowed him
to return home to recuperate.

06:40.480 --> 06:42.010
I wonder when he'll arrive?

06:45.830 --> 06:47.830
I'm afraid you'll be disappointed,
Lord Yan.

06:47.830 --> 06:48.720
Shu has

06:49.040 --> 06:50.510
an old injury in his back

06:51.190 --> 06:53.250
and cannot sit in a carriage for long,

06:53.560 --> 06:55.120
so he hired a boat

06:55.190 --> 06:56.250
to travel by water.

06:56.830 --> 06:58.040
This detour

06:58.720 --> 07:00.000
will likely

07:00.800 --> 07:02.070
take some time.

07:03.480 --> 07:05.120
That's truly a pity.

07:05.720 --> 07:06.800
It seems

07:07.830 --> 07:10.290
I won't have the chance to meet him
after all.

07:12.360 --> 07:14.120
I see the fire did quite a bit of damage.

07:14.120 --> 07:15.920
You must've suffered
some pretty heavy losses.

07:15.920 --> 07:17.040
So, Zhengjun,

07:17.800 --> 07:19.060
why don't you consider

07:19.270 --> 07:21.670
selling your family's grain reserve to me?

07:22.070 --> 07:24.530
It might help make up for
some of your losses.

07:24.630 --> 07:25.490
Your Lordship,

07:25.680 --> 07:27.430
it's not that I'm unwilling to sell.

07:27.430 --> 07:29.490
We simply have no surplus grain left.

07:29.560 --> 07:31.000
Don't try to fool me.

07:32.390 --> 07:34.920
Just a few days ago, you had
30 boatloads of fresh grain.

07:34.920 --> 07:36.190
It's true—we transported the grain

07:36.190 --> 07:38.250
out of the city overnight yesterday.

07:38.510 --> 07:39.800
Those 30 boatloads

07:40.070 --> 07:42.000
have already passed Menghu Gorge.

07:45.240 --> 07:46.770
What, you don't believe me?

07:47.120 --> 07:47.750
Look,

07:48.310 --> 07:50.240
I even have the travel permit here.

07:53.720 --> 07:56.590
[Detailed Grain Shipment Record]

07:56.659 --> 07:57.460
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

07:59.360 --> 07:59.820
My Lord.

08:00.750 --> 08:01.920
Go check immediately

08:01.920 --> 08:03.430
to see whether the amount of grain
listed on the Xie family's travel permits

08:03.430 --> 08:06.070
matches the quantities
recorded in their ledgers.

08:06.070 --> 08:06.750
Yes.

08:07.870 --> 08:09.190
My Lord, are you suggesting

08:09.190 --> 08:10.630
they might've been swapping the grain,

08:10.630 --> 08:11.920
using the Xie family's caravans

08:11.920 --> 08:14.430
to smuggle relief grain out of Hengtang
in batches,

08:14.430 --> 08:16.230
sell it, then bring back
the same amount of stale rice

08:16.230 --> 08:17.800
to distribute to the refugees?

08:17.800 --> 08:19.060
That's what I suspect.

08:20.870 --> 08:23.190
Hengtang has suffered disasters
year after year,

08:23.190 --> 08:25.830
yet the Xie family is constantly
shipping out dozens,

08:25.830 --> 08:27.960
even hundreds, of boatloads of grain.

08:28.830 --> 08:30.830
Where is all that grain coming from?

08:31.630 --> 08:34.030
And why have the court's relief officials

08:34.030 --> 08:35.909
repeatedly failed to make any headway?

08:35.909 --> 08:37.240
Something's not right.

08:40.789 --> 08:41.650
I have a feeling

08:42.510 --> 08:44.710
that the Xie family is the breakthrough

08:45.030 --> 08:46.870
we need in this embezzlement case.

08:46.870 --> 08:50.340
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

09:05.790 --> 09:06.650
Your Lordship.

09:06.670 --> 09:09.200
You're personally adorning the Buddha
with auspicious markings.

09:09.200 --> 09:11.150
Heaven will surely be moved
by your sincerity,

09:11.150 --> 09:13.240
driving away evil spirits
and watching over us,

09:13.240 --> 09:15.080
keeping us safe and blessed.

09:15.080 --> 09:15.910
Yes, indeed.

09:18.080 --> 09:18.790
Lord Wei?

09:19.910 --> 09:20.770
Your Lordship?

09:22.000 --> 09:23.260
Don't panic, you guys.

09:24.790 --> 09:25.650
Your Lordship.

09:26.320 --> 09:27.250
Why don't we just

09:27.270 --> 09:28.130
trade our grain

09:28.200 --> 09:29.260
with him for money?

09:29.630 --> 09:31.200
Trade?
How much are you planning to trade?

09:31.200 --> 09:32.200
Would any of the grain we have left

09:32.200 --> 09:33.260
survive scrutiny?

09:33.600 --> 09:35.600
What if Yan Rui turns on us
and denies everything?

09:35.600 --> 09:37.360
We'd have far more to lose.

09:37.510 --> 09:38.120
Exactly.

09:38.480 --> 09:40.240
At a time like this, handing over grain

09:40.240 --> 09:41.360
would be far too risky.

09:41.360 --> 09:42.910
We can't afford to take that gamble.

09:42.910 --> 09:44.310
Yeah, we can't afford it.

09:46.480 --> 09:47.200
Lord Wei,

09:47.550 --> 09:48.720
what do you think?

09:50.600 --> 09:51.460
Your Lordship.

09:51.910 --> 09:54.040
Your Lordship, please say something!

09:58.240 --> 10:00.150
County Sheriff is absolutely right.

10:00.150 --> 10:00.870
Yes.

10:06.630 --> 10:07.670
Yan Rui

10:08.320 --> 10:11.550
is determined to investigate
the Xie family estate manager's case.

10:11.550 --> 10:13.210
If he's only after some grain,

10:14.080 --> 10:15.480
that's no great concern.

10:17.200 --> 10:19.360
What worries me is that
he may have another motive,

10:19.360 --> 10:21.240
so we must not let our guard down.

10:22.480 --> 10:23.810
But for now, gentlemen,

10:23.870 --> 10:25.120
stay calm.

10:26.360 --> 10:27.620
Go home and await word.

10:28.510 --> 10:30.320
-Well…
-Await word?

10:31.750 --> 10:33.550
Please, Buddha, bless us!

10:33.910 --> 10:35.510
Please let that demon Yan Rui

10:35.510 --> 10:38.170
get the hell out of Hengtang
as soon as possible!

10:44.440 --> 10:45.200
Ji San,

10:49.630 --> 10:50.750
go get Guo Baofeng.

11:02.270 --> 11:02.960
My Lord.

11:04.000 --> 11:06.660
We've found the murderer of
the estate manager.

11:08.270 --> 11:10.480
But he'd already been silenced
by the time we found him.

11:10.480 --> 11:11.000
My Lord,

11:11.600 --> 11:12.730
we've hit a dead end.

11:39.030 --> 11:41.030
There's very little information
on this guy.

11:41.030 --> 11:42.870
We only found that
he'd gotten into trouble in the northwest.

11:42.870 --> 11:43.790
Nothing else.

11:55.550 --> 11:57.030
Those hands...

11:57.360 --> 11:59.000
He used to be a carpenter.

12:05.270 --> 12:05.870
Changyan.

12:06.720 --> 12:07.480
Come up and talk.

12:07.480 --> 12:08.270
Alright.

12:12.720 --> 12:13.320
Changyan,

12:13.550 --> 12:14.320
you're really

12:14.320 --> 12:15.580
getting the hang of it.

12:16.200 --> 12:16.840
Baofeng.

12:17.630 --> 12:18.600
I heard

12:19.000 --> 12:21.330
it was you who killed that estate manager?

12:22.150 --> 12:22.600
Yes,

12:22.720 --> 12:23.450
I killed him.

12:26.790 --> 12:27.650
You killed him?

12:27.910 --> 12:28.360
Yes.

12:28.390 --> 12:29.510
You're really something else.

12:29.510 --> 12:30.770
Nothing gets past you.

12:32.510 --> 12:33.640
Why did you kill him?

12:37.120 --> 12:38.650
Who ordered you to kill him?

12:39.320 --> 12:40.440
Who ordered you to kill him?

12:40.440 --> 12:41.630
Changyan! Changyan.

12:41.630 --> 12:42.230
Changyan.

12:42.360 --> 12:44.480
That wretched servant
worked at the Xie Estate

12:44.480 --> 12:46.200
and secretly kept a ledger
of our dealings.

12:46.200 --> 12:48.480
My men learned he was going to
report it to Yan Rui,

12:48.480 --> 12:49.240
so I had no choice

12:49.240 --> 12:50.390
but to strike first!

12:50.390 --> 12:51.390
You fool!

12:51.670 --> 12:53.080
Yan Rui is notorious.

12:53.320 --> 12:54.390
Think about it—

12:54.670 --> 12:55.720
why would that estate manager

12:55.720 --> 12:57.440
choose him to expose the truth?

12:57.440 --> 12:58.630
Have you ever wondered why?

12:58.630 --> 13:01.030
You mean Yan Rui is hiding
something from us?

13:01.030 --> 13:01.840
Changyan! Changyan!

13:01.840 --> 13:02.840
I acted rashly.

13:03.360 --> 13:04.630
I was only worried

13:04.840 --> 13:05.720
that once the ledger was exposed,

13:05.720 --> 13:07.390
you'd be implicated, Changyan.

13:07.390 --> 13:08.480
Where's the ledger?

13:08.480 --> 13:08.910
Changyan!

13:08.910 --> 13:10.150
The ledger fell into the river

13:10.150 --> 13:11.030
the night the estate manager died

13:11.030 --> 13:12.270
and was swept away by the current!

13:12.270 --> 13:13.730
No one knows where it went!

13:20.810 --> 13:22.910
[Respectfully Awaiting Your Presence
at the Shangsi Gathering]

13:22.930 --> 13:25.070
[Presented by the Founding Count's Family
to the Esteemed Xie Household]

13:23.550 --> 13:25.120
You could've simply

13:25.440 --> 13:27.550
sent a servant to deliver the invitation.

13:27.550 --> 13:29.480
There was no need for you, Lady Prefect,

13:29.480 --> 13:30.720
to come in person.

13:32.390 --> 13:33.910
The invitation may be a small matter,

13:33.910 --> 13:35.200
but the banquet is not.

13:35.630 --> 13:37.360
[Lady Prefect]

13:35.840 --> 13:36.900
Well, you're aware

13:37.030 --> 13:40.080
why this Spring Banquet is being held.

13:41.480 --> 13:44.870
It concerns the selection of
the Founding Count family's Head Madam,

13:44.870 --> 13:46.730
so we must take every precaution.

13:47.000 --> 13:47.840
Indeed.

13:48.080 --> 13:49.630
We'll just have to see

13:49.750 --> 13:51.270
which young lady

13:51.550 --> 13:53.480
can win Her Ladyship's favor then.

13:55.150 --> 13:55.750
By the way,

13:56.000 --> 13:59.200
are the introductory gifts
for the Spring Banquet ready?

14:24.200 --> 14:26.320
Which young lady made this?

14:26.630 --> 14:28.200
It's exquisite.

14:32.200 --> 14:34.600
These Go stones are beautifully polished.

14:35.240 --> 14:36.480
Founding Countess

14:36.670 --> 14:37.910
adores playing Go,

14:38.240 --> 14:39.030
so this gift

14:39.480 --> 14:41.550
is sure to please her.

14:44.480 --> 14:46.790
Eldest Lady made this
in her spare time.

14:53.480 --> 14:54.320
And look,

14:54.630 --> 14:57.000
Qingrong's embroidery,
"Spring's Unparalleled Beauty",

14:57.000 --> 14:58.550
is quite elegant too.

15:00.360 --> 15:02.870
Why don't I see Fourth Lady's gift?

15:04.360 --> 15:07.020
Qingyuan went out to run an errand
for Old Madam.

15:07.600 --> 15:09.200
She only recently returned to the family

15:09.200 --> 15:11.080
and still has much to learn,

15:11.480 --> 15:12.670
so she didn't have time

15:12.670 --> 15:13.960
to prepare a gift.

15:14.270 --> 15:15.240
Please forgive

15:15.440 --> 15:16.570
our lack of manners.

15:17.150 --> 15:18.910
They're all fine young ladies,

15:19.390 --> 15:21.120
and the gifts are all lovely.

15:21.440 --> 15:23.200
Even if Fourth Lady is busy,

15:23.630 --> 15:24.750
it's the thought

15:24.910 --> 15:25.960
that counts.

15:26.910 --> 15:27.630
Of course.

15:28.630 --> 15:29.690
Please take a seat.

15:32.910 --> 15:33.630
Put it down!

15:33.750 --> 15:34.550
Shut up!

15:35.550 --> 15:37.150
A born wretch like you

15:37.390 --> 15:39.320
thinks you're fit to use Go stones?

15:39.670 --> 15:41.200
I'd say the mud at the bottom of the pond

15:41.200 --> 15:42.600
suits you better.

15:45.750 --> 15:47.060
I polished them myself!

15:47.060 --> 15:48.670
So what if you polished them yourself?

15:48.670 --> 15:50.150
Who do you think you are?

15:50.630 --> 15:51.490
Second Sister,

15:51.750 --> 15:52.540
please.

15:52.570 --> 15:53.960
I won't fight you over anything.

15:53.960 --> 15:54.840
Everything's yours.

15:54.840 --> 15:55.720
I'm begging you.

15:55.720 --> 15:56.440
Stop throwing them!

15:56.440 --> 15:57.390
I'm begging you!

15:57.430 --> 15:59.090
You're just like your mother—

15:59.440 --> 16:01.100
both utterly beneath notice.

16:02.870 --> 16:03.730
Second Sister.

16:05.720 --> 16:08.320
Is this a copy of Zhao Chang's painting?

16:11.720 --> 16:13.050
It's beautifully done.

16:13.150 --> 16:14.390
Put it down.

16:16.870 --> 16:17.360
Yes.

16:19.870 --> 16:20.360
You...

16:21.360 --> 16:22.290
My hand slipped.

16:23.120 --> 16:24.120
Don't listen to her nonsense.

16:24.120 --> 16:24.910
She only knows how to play innocent.

16:24.910 --> 16:27.120
-How dare you...
-Second Sister. Third Sister.

16:27.120 --> 16:29.720
You both know how to protect
your own hard work,

16:29.870 --> 16:31.270
so why treat Eldest Sister's

16:31.270 --> 16:32.870
hard work

16:33.030 --> 16:34.120
as worthless?

16:34.510 --> 16:35.600
You little wretch.

16:36.030 --> 16:37.720
How dare you lecture me?

16:38.360 --> 16:39.020
Let go of me!

16:39.120 --> 16:39.790
Let go of me!

16:41.240 --> 16:41.750
Let go!

16:42.150 --> 16:43.000
What are you waiting for?

16:43.000 --> 16:43.790
Get her!

16:44.750 --> 16:46.950
-Throw her into the water!
-Let go of me!

16:47.480 --> 16:48.600
-Let go of me!
-Second Sister!

16:48.600 --> 16:50.000
This has nothing to do with Fourth Sister!

16:50.000 --> 16:51.080
Let her go!

16:51.080 --> 16:51.720
Let me go!

16:51.720 --> 16:52.480
Let go!

16:53.750 --> 16:55.320
Today, I'll show you

16:55.320 --> 16:56.670
who rules this Xie household!

16:56.670 --> 16:57.480
Push her in!

16:58.240 --> 16:59.030
Stop!

16:59.840 --> 17:00.900
What are you doing?

17:13.030 --> 17:14.240
Put it down.

17:16.310 --> 17:16.790
Yes.

17:18.109 --> 17:18.720
You...

17:37.920 --> 17:40.750
This is perilla candy
Granny taught me to make.

17:41.160 --> 17:42.820
Please accept them, Lord Yan.

17:46.400 --> 17:47.070
My Lord.

17:48.070 --> 17:49.720
My Lord, are you taking medicine?

17:49.720 --> 17:50.480
Are you sick?

17:50.640 --> 17:51.440
I'll go get a doctor.

17:51.440 --> 17:51.960
No need.

17:52.590 --> 17:53.880
Any leads?

17:54.270 --> 17:56.480
I found a flower token on the murderer

17:56.480 --> 17:57.590
and traced it back.

17:57.880 --> 17:58.960
Only Zuixian Tavern

17:58.960 --> 18:01.070
uses this kind of premium flower paper,

18:01.070 --> 18:01.880
with a delicate

18:01.880 --> 18:03.880
little wine jug painted on the back.

18:04.440 --> 18:06.790
One token is given
for every 50 taels spent.

18:06.790 --> 18:08.270
Every official
at the Hengtang county government

18:08.270 --> 18:09.480
has one on their desk.

18:09.640 --> 18:12.240
And Second Young Master Xie
is a regular there.

18:15.440 --> 18:16.640
The Xie family again.

18:17.440 --> 18:18.550
My Lord, are you waiting for

18:18.550 --> 18:20.210
Xie Shu to return to Hengtang?

18:20.750 --> 18:22.400
What if he doesn't come back anytime soon?

18:22.400 --> 18:23.440
What do we do then?

18:26.160 --> 18:27.450
Wine, women, wealth, and power.

18:27.450 --> 18:29.290
There's plenty I can do.

18:29.400 --> 18:32.070
Isn't the Spring Banquet
for the Shangsi Festival coming up?

18:32.070 --> 18:33.590
Let's just wait a little longer.

18:33.590 --> 18:34.680
W... Wait?

18:35.440 --> 18:36.900
Wait until this rain falls

18:37.550 --> 18:39.680
and the waters of Hengtang turn murky.

18:39.960 --> 18:41.490
Once the waters turn murky,

18:41.920 --> 18:43.510
we can start fishing.

18:45.160 --> 18:52.860
[A Legacy of Virtue for Eternity]

18:47.790 --> 18:49.000
It was all my fault.

18:49.790 --> 18:52.250
I shouldn't have argued
with Second Sister.

18:55.590 --> 18:56.680
Just now,

18:57.790 --> 18:59.960
you took all the blame upon yourself...

18:59.960 --> 19:00.790
I'm fine.

19:01.480 --> 19:03.010
You needn't worry about me.

19:03.550 --> 19:06.030
When you go back, remember to
comfort Third Madam.

19:06.030 --> 19:07.160
Don't let her worry.

19:09.550 --> 19:11.150
But in these inner quarters,

19:11.640 --> 19:14.880
the truth is often
the least important thing.

19:16.680 --> 19:17.920
I only hope

19:18.480 --> 19:20.480
I can live peacefully with my mother

19:20.830 --> 19:22.510
here at Hanxiang Parlor.

19:23.000 --> 19:24.030
Is that so?

19:26.270 --> 19:28.270
My mother used to think the same way.

19:29.070 --> 19:30.270
But you've all seen

19:31.070 --> 19:32.350
how it ended for her.

19:35.070 --> 19:36.800
Second Sister and Third Sister

19:36.920 --> 19:39.320
can afford to be so spoiled
and overbearing

19:40.030 --> 19:42.350
because they have Head Madam's protection.

19:42.350 --> 19:43.410
But what about you?

19:44.440 --> 19:46.640
When your mother was wrongfully accused,

19:46.640 --> 19:48.370
there was nothing you could do.

19:50.920 --> 19:53.070
Because you simply didn't stand
high enough.

19:53.070 --> 19:54.530
Even if you keep yielding,

19:54.720 --> 19:55.650
again and again,

19:56.070 --> 19:57.130
you and your mother

19:57.680 --> 19:59.030
will still be bullied

19:59.440 --> 20:00.510
and humiliated.

20:03.830 --> 20:04.690
Eldest Sister.

20:05.400 --> 20:06.400
Are you truly

20:07.240 --> 20:09.400
willing to be a discarded pawn?

20:20.550 --> 20:21.810
You still have a choice

20:23.110 --> 20:24.480
in which path you take.

20:54.600 --> 20:59.260
[A Legacy of Virtue for Eternity]

21:07.350 --> 21:08.110
Lord Yan.

21:08.830 --> 21:12.000
Are you going to keep investigating
the estate manager's case?

21:12.000 --> 21:13.680
I need to notify the government

21:13.680 --> 21:15.810
and make the necessary arrangements.

21:21.590 --> 21:22.590
You may leave us.

21:34.590 --> 21:36.200
I couldn't care less

21:36.270 --> 21:37.870
how the estate manager died.

21:37.960 --> 21:39.110
What I care about

21:39.640 --> 21:42.350
is the grain he had that's now missing.

21:44.790 --> 21:45.850
You mean the grain?

21:46.350 --> 21:47.240
Exactly.

21:47.440 --> 21:50.000
The relief grain we've received
is nowhere near enough.

21:50.000 --> 21:51.680
If you gentlemen

21:51.790 --> 21:53.160
weren't hoarding your grain so tightly

21:53.160 --> 21:54.720
and refusing to sell it to me,

21:54.720 --> 21:55.380
I wouldn't have to keep

21:55.380 --> 21:58.240
squeezing grain out of the Xie family
day after day.

22:01.200 --> 22:02.590
Luckily, I've come into

22:02.920 --> 22:04.480
a little extra money today.

22:05.030 --> 22:06.880
If you gentlemen trust me,

22:06.880 --> 22:08.880
I'm willing to double the price

22:09.590 --> 22:10.650
I pay for the grain.

22:11.110 --> 22:12.310
All I ask

22:12.550 --> 22:15.210
is that you help me out of
this urgent situation.

22:24.750 --> 22:25.720
Nice wine.

22:27.160 --> 22:29.680
Since you're being so generous, Lord Yan,

22:30.350 --> 22:31.070
we can

22:31.590 --> 22:33.440
hardly refuse.

22:34.750 --> 22:35.440
Gentlemen,

22:36.720 --> 22:39.320
if you'd like to trade your grain
with Lord Yan,

22:39.550 --> 22:40.950
please feel free to do so.

22:42.200 --> 22:43.310
Great. Excellent.

22:54.350 --> 22:55.590
In that case...

22:55.640 --> 22:56.720
Sheriff He.

22:56.960 --> 22:57.820
Your Lordship.

22:58.000 --> 22:59.440
Just find some excuse

22:59.480 --> 23:02.210
and close the case of
the estate manager's death.

23:02.270 --> 23:04.440
We can't let the Xie family's money

23:04.440 --> 23:05.110
go to waste,

23:05.110 --> 23:05.880
can we?

23:07.110 --> 23:08.000
I understand.

23:08.750 --> 23:09.310
Come on,

23:09.720 --> 23:10.780
a toast to Lord Yan.

23:10.830 --> 23:11.400
Come on.

23:12.510 --> 23:13.970
-To Lord Yan.
-To Lord Yan.

23:22.080 --> 23:24.500
[Wuzhu Courtyard]

23:22.440 --> 23:23.970
Qingru may be thoughtless,

23:24.920 --> 23:26.450
but you should know better!

23:26.720 --> 23:28.550
With such a distinguished guest present,

23:28.550 --> 23:30.480
how could you be so lacking in tact?

23:31.590 --> 23:32.850
You're right, Mother.

23:33.400 --> 23:34.750
I was wrong.

23:35.350 --> 23:36.400
But it was

23:36.720 --> 23:38.650
that wretched girl who started it.

23:38.790 --> 23:40.330
She was the one
who tore Second Sister's painting first.

23:40.330 --> 23:43.130
Even so, it was not your place
to teach her a lesson.

23:47.480 --> 23:48.200
Madam.

23:48.510 --> 23:51.750
Qingyuan took all the blame upon herself

23:52.030 --> 23:54.270
and begged Old Madam to release Qinghe.

23:54.640 --> 23:56.240
Old Madam agreed,

23:56.350 --> 24:00.480
but she was furious that she had been
embarrassed in front of Lady Prefect.

24:00.830 --> 24:01.790
Madam,

24:01.920 --> 24:04.550
you know what Second Madam is like.

24:04.960 --> 24:06.420
She's taking this opportunity

24:06.420 --> 24:08.690
to have Nanny Rong handle this matter.

24:08.920 --> 24:10.590
With all these old and new grievances,

24:10.590 --> 24:12.390
there's bound to be a commotion.

24:12.400 --> 24:15.030
Let's just sit back and enjoy the show.

24:18.270 --> 24:19.330
How dare you smile?

24:19.960 --> 24:21.620
Old Madam may have spared you,

24:21.680 --> 24:22.940
but I certainly won't.

24:23.680 --> 24:25.960
Go and copy the Heart Sutra 100 times.

24:27.550 --> 24:28.310
Got it.

24:31.830 --> 24:33.400
I took all the blame

24:33.920 --> 24:36.450
so Old Madam would feel
even more sorry for me—

24:37.030 --> 24:39.230
and so that those with ulterior motives

24:39.920 --> 24:41.850
would willingly walk into my trap.

24:42.110 --> 24:46.890
[A Legacy of Virtue for Eternity]

24:47.550 --> 24:48.590
Fourth Lady.

24:48.750 --> 24:50.410
Please come to the front hall.

24:57.400 --> 25:00.030
Everyone's waiting.

25:01.400 --> 25:02.270
Very well.

25:03.070 --> 25:06.270
It may seem as if I've fallen into
the hands of a wicked servant like you,

25:06.270 --> 25:09.600
but this is also my chance
to turn your own blade against you.

25:26.270 --> 25:28.640
Fourth Lady, please.

25:32.490 --> 25:35.600
[Jingmu Hall]

25:45.000 --> 25:46.720
Old Madam punished me by making me kneel
in the ancestral hall,

25:46.720 --> 25:48.480
but she never said I'd be flogged.

25:48.480 --> 25:51.280
Are you taking advantage
of the situation, Nanny?

25:53.920 --> 25:55.720
How could you say that, Fourth Lady?

25:55.720 --> 25:58.750
I'd never dare to abuse my position
to settle a personal grudge.

25:58.750 --> 26:00.680
According to the Xie family rules,

26:01.240 --> 26:03.350
for disobeying your elder sister
and offending a distinguished guest,

26:03.350 --> 26:04.830
you deserve 10 lashes.

26:05.400 --> 26:06.640
Old Madam

26:06.680 --> 26:07.640
simply forgot.

26:08.440 --> 26:10.790
So as the governess,

26:11.480 --> 26:13.680
I'm merely helping to enforce the rule.

26:25.640 --> 26:27.170
Do the family rules specify

26:27.440 --> 26:29.770
that the cane must be
dipped in salt water?

26:31.590 --> 26:33.440
You're indeed smart, Fourth Lady.

26:33.440 --> 26:35.240
You even know this is salt water.

26:35.960 --> 26:39.000
The rules only say 10 lashes—

26:39.590 --> 26:42.480
they never specify
what kind of whip to use.

26:43.350 --> 26:44.110
Fine.

26:44.550 --> 26:45.950
Since it's a family rule,

26:46.200 --> 26:48.000
then you may carry it out, Nanny.

26:49.350 --> 26:51.200
But let me remind you:

26:52.160 --> 26:54.690
however many lashes
you strike me with today,

26:54.790 --> 26:55.640
I will

26:55.830 --> 26:57.680
return them in full one day.

27:00.350 --> 27:01.550
Fourth Lady,

27:01.720 --> 27:03.310
that's quite a bold claim.

27:03.570 --> 27:09.370
[Jingmu Hall]

27:04.070 --> 27:05.270
Did you all hear that?

27:08.240 --> 27:09.370
Look who's talking.

27:09.960 --> 27:11.750
First survive

27:12.160 --> 27:13.090
these 10 lashes,

27:13.510 --> 27:14.370
then we'll see.

27:16.480 --> 27:17.280
Take her away!

27:19.220 --> 27:20.770
[Jingmu Hall]

27:26.550 --> 27:28.070
Xie Qingyuan,

27:28.350 --> 27:29.790
look at you now!

27:32.240 --> 27:32.920
Back off.

27:49.350 --> 27:50.680
Maybe we should call it a day.

27:50.680 --> 27:52.310
Keep this up and you'll kill her.

27:52.310 --> 27:54.240
Since when do you get to lecture me?

28:17.960 --> 28:19.000
Xie Qingyuan.

28:19.110 --> 28:21.640
You've got quite a stiff backbone,
don't you?

28:22.030 --> 28:23.550
Much tougher than your mother was

28:23.550 --> 28:24.960
back then.

28:25.000 --> 28:28.610
[Jingmu Hall]

28:32.110 --> 28:35.160
Why don't you follow your mother's example
and bow your head in apology?

28:35.160 --> 28:37.790
Then I might let you off the hook.

28:47.550 --> 28:48.750
Very well, very well.

28:50.000 --> 28:53.750
Since you refuse to take the easy way out,

28:54.400 --> 28:55.660
I'll teach you a lesson

28:56.920 --> 28:58.480
the hard way!

29:01.280 --> 29:01.800
[Jingmu Hall]

29:14.350 --> 29:15.680
Lord Yan.

29:19.200 --> 29:20.640
I had no idea

29:21.070 --> 29:22.730
the rules of the Xie household

29:23.550 --> 29:25.030
were set by a mere servant.

29:26.790 --> 29:28.000
Lord Yan,

29:29.000 --> 29:30.800
this is a private family matter—

29:43.030 --> 29:44.440
Lord Yan, you…

29:51.920 --> 29:53.580
Since you're so fond of rules,

29:53.880 --> 29:56.440
I'll let you experience your own rules
firsthand.

29:56.440 --> 29:57.270
Fan Zhong.

29:58.240 --> 29:59.070
No, no, no...

29:59.830 --> 30:00.510
Lord Yan.

30:00.960 --> 30:01.640
Lord Fan.

30:01.920 --> 30:03.650
I was simply following orders.

30:09.350 --> 30:13.640
-I can't possibly stand your whipping...
-You're so skilled at interrogation.

30:13.640 --> 30:15.790
It's a waste of your talent
to stay with the Xie family.

30:15.790 --> 30:17.350
Why don't you come work for
the Criminal Justice Office instead?

30:17.350 --> 30:19.480
You can have a proper discussion

30:20.030 --> 30:21.830
with my subordinate, Fan Zhong.

30:23.830 --> 30:24.790
Yan Rui!

30:25.720 --> 30:27.780
You're being utterly presumptuous!

30:32.030 --> 30:32.750
Keep beating her!

30:32.750 --> 30:33.750
Old Madam!

30:34.000 --> 30:35.160
Save me!

30:40.070 --> 30:41.790
What on earth is going on?

30:42.070 --> 30:42.960
Lord Yan.

30:43.350 --> 30:46.010
Our Xie family is a prestigious clan,
after all.

30:46.030 --> 30:47.240
Do you truly intend to

30:47.270 --> 30:49.750
show such disrespect to our patriarch?

30:50.960 --> 30:51.920
Your patriarch?

30:53.750 --> 30:55.640
I answer only to His Majesty.

30:56.270 --> 30:57.880
Even a feudal prince

30:58.310 --> 31:00.070
has no hold over me.

31:01.000 --> 31:03.550
If you think invoking Xie Shu
will intimidate me,

31:03.550 --> 31:05.110
perhaps you've grown senile.

31:05.110 --> 31:05.590
You...

31:05.590 --> 31:06.310
Fan Zhong.

31:06.750 --> 31:07.750
Keep her alive

31:08.030 --> 31:09.430
and take good care of her.

31:09.510 --> 31:10.110
Yes!

31:11.240 --> 31:12.720
Save me, Second Madam!

31:13.440 --> 31:14.270
What a joke!

31:14.680 --> 31:17.410
I'd like to see who dares
step out that gate today!

31:17.480 --> 31:20.240
Do you truly think
you can bully our Xie family

31:20.240 --> 31:22.240
just because there's no one here
to stand up for us?

31:22.240 --> 31:23.770
How formidable, Old Madam.

31:24.960 --> 31:26.550
Looks like you've been
letting these lackeys

31:26.550 --> 31:29.750
throw their weight around in your name
for quite some time.

31:29.750 --> 31:32.550
No wonder they've all grown
so full of themselves.

31:32.550 --> 31:34.750
I happen to have some free time tonight,

31:35.110 --> 31:37.570
so I'm kindly teaching them a lesson
for you.

31:41.830 --> 31:43.830
Aren't you worried
I'll file an imperial petition

31:43.830 --> 31:46.360
-and bring you before His Majesty?
-Go ahead.

31:46.880 --> 31:48.640
But you'll have to take a number.

31:48.640 --> 31:52.030
There must be hundreds of petitions
filed against me before His Majesty.

31:52.030 --> 31:53.890
One more won't make a difference.

31:53.920 --> 31:55.310
It's just Lord Xie's been

31:55.310 --> 31:58.970
working diligently to build his career
in the Northern Frontier,

31:59.000 --> 32:01.750
only to have his reputation ruined

32:02.000 --> 32:03.590
by these ignorant women at home.

32:03.590 --> 32:04.750
What a shame.

32:06.590 --> 32:07.200
You...

32:07.510 --> 32:08.110
You...

32:08.510 --> 32:09.110
You...

32:09.350 --> 32:10.310
Xie Qingyuan

32:10.750 --> 32:13.400
is a key witness in a case
under my authority.

32:14.000 --> 32:16.260
I'm taking her into protective custody.

32:16.920 --> 32:18.240
Any objections?

32:21.350 --> 32:22.440
Even if there is,

32:23.350 --> 32:24.550
I couldn't care less.

33:00.960 --> 33:03.090
Thank you for saving my life, Lord Yan.

33:03.880 --> 33:05.030
But it's so late.

33:06.110 --> 33:08.240
What brought you to the Xie Residence?

33:14.070 --> 33:16.270
If you hadn't gone to such great lengths

33:16.680 --> 33:18.350
to make those poisoned candies for me—

33:18.350 --> 33:20.640
causing my heart to race uncontrollably,
my inner energy to stagnate,

33:20.640 --> 33:22.160
and even making me cough up blood—

33:22.160 --> 33:23.720
how could I have been so rude

33:23.720 --> 33:26.110
as to go to the Xie Residence
to look for you, lady?

33:26.110 --> 33:26.830
Poison?

33:30.880 --> 33:32.740
Your Lordship, give me your hand.

33:49.200 --> 33:51.200
Your Lordship,
I'm afraid you've misunderstood.

33:51.200 --> 33:52.590
Did you perhaps

33:53.030 --> 33:55.720
channel your energy
or practice martial arts

33:55.960 --> 33:57.760
after eating the perilla candy?

33:59.160 --> 34:02.690
It's my fault for not explaining this
clearly to Your Lordship.

34:02.880 --> 34:07.240
This perilla candy is meant to
refresh the mind and sharpen the senses,

34:07.270 --> 34:10.400
so it contains not only mint and ice leaf,

34:10.880 --> 34:12.280
but also a small amount of

34:13.110 --> 34:14.110
toad venom

34:14.360 --> 34:16.480
to invigorate blood circulation
and dispel blood stasis.

34:16.480 --> 34:17.710
Both ingredients

34:18.150 --> 34:19.630
are extremely potent.

34:20.030 --> 34:21.320
Within 8 hours

34:21.630 --> 34:23.159
after taking the medicine,

34:23.480 --> 34:24.920
you must not practice martial arts

34:24.920 --> 34:26.250
or channel your energy.

34:27.440 --> 34:28.630
Ordinary people

34:29.230 --> 34:31.070
won't have any problems after eating it.

34:31.070 --> 34:33.130
If Your Lordship doesn't believe me,

34:33.760 --> 34:35.159
you can test it yourself.

35:14.480 --> 35:15.480
Now you

35:16.840 --> 35:17.900
believe me, right?

35:19.000 --> 35:21.670
It is my fault

35:22.070 --> 35:24.470
that Your Lordship
had to suffer like that.

35:26.190 --> 35:28.390
But you accused me of trying to harm you—

35:28.480 --> 35:29.840
how could I have known

35:30.230 --> 35:31.830
when you'd take the medicine

35:32.000 --> 35:33.800
or practice martial arts?

35:40.110 --> 35:41.370
Since that's the case,

35:42.230 --> 35:45.070
may I get off the carriage?

35:53.960 --> 35:55.360
Xie Qingyuan.

35:55.840 --> 35:58.510
You certainly have some nerve.

36:00.190 --> 36:02.000
Of all the things you could have done,

36:02.000 --> 36:04.190
you chose to try your tricks on me.

36:09.670 --> 36:11.550
I don't care why you're so determined

36:11.550 --> 36:12.950
to stay in the Xie family,

36:13.710 --> 36:14.770
but remember this:

36:15.920 --> 36:18.440
if you ever provoke me again,
I'll formally

36:19.030 --> 36:22.360
send a proposal to the Xie family
to take you as my concubine,

36:22.960 --> 36:25.030
then lock you away in the Yan Residence

36:25.030 --> 36:26.670
and make sure you never set foot

36:26.670 --> 36:28.200
in the Xie Residence again.

36:32.070 --> 36:33.070
Let me get off.

36:39.030 --> 36:40.360
Old Madam!

36:41.360 --> 36:43.590
You must stand up for me!

36:43.840 --> 36:46.710
Even when you beat a dog,
you have to consider its owner, right?

36:46.710 --> 36:48.670
Look what Lord Yan

36:49.230 --> 36:50.110
did to me

36:50.110 --> 36:53.000
just for the sake of Fourth Lady!

36:53.630 --> 36:56.550
If you'd arrived a bit later,

36:56.880 --> 37:00.480
I'd never have been able to
serve you again...

37:03.230 --> 37:04.030
Old Madam,

37:04.440 --> 37:05.590
just look at her.

37:06.070 --> 37:08.900
Whether we brought in a mascot or a jinx,

37:09.190 --> 37:10.850
we have to judge by the events.

37:11.150 --> 37:12.710
With all the commotion tonight—

37:12.710 --> 37:14.110
the chaos and uproar—

37:14.480 --> 37:17.540
how are we, the Xie family,
supposed to hold our heads up

37:17.670 --> 37:19.130
anywhere in Hengtang now?

37:23.230 --> 37:24.030
Mother.

37:24.320 --> 37:27.480
Lord Yan is, after all,
a rising star at court.

37:27.760 --> 37:28.710
Perhaps...

37:30.550 --> 37:32.510
Perhaps he simply couldn't control

37:32.510 --> 37:33.920
his feelings for Qingyuan

37:33.920 --> 37:35.480
and, out of concern for her safety,

37:35.480 --> 37:37.410
resorted to this absurd behavior.

37:37.550 --> 37:39.000
My dear Head Madam.

37:39.840 --> 37:42.500
You think Qingyuan
is some priceless treasure?

37:42.800 --> 37:44.400
To be snatched away

37:44.480 --> 37:46.590
by a stranger in the dead of night…

37:49.800 --> 37:51.190
Sorry, I misspoke.

37:52.230 --> 37:54.590
I mean, she was "escorted away."

37:55.320 --> 37:56.650
If word of this gets out,

37:57.030 --> 37:58.260
the whole of Hengtang

37:58.280 --> 37:59.880
will laugh themselves sick.

38:00.230 --> 38:02.710
No one will say your daughter

38:02.880 --> 38:05.960
is a virtuous maiden
worthy of a gentleman's courtship.

38:05.960 --> 38:08.070
They'll only say our Xie family

38:08.070 --> 38:10.630
-has raised a shameless little...
-Enough.

38:15.840 --> 38:16.760
Old Madam!

38:16.960 --> 38:17.630
Old Madam!

38:18.030 --> 38:19.280
A letter from Master.

38:32.750 --> 38:33.710
Young Master!

38:32.770 --> 38:35.340
[Zuixian Tavern]

38:40.190 --> 38:41.710
I want to go back to the tea house.

38:41.710 --> 38:43.590
If you go back looking like this,

38:44.070 --> 38:45.930
Granny Chen will be worried sick.

38:46.230 --> 38:47.000
Fine.

38:47.670 --> 38:49.870
Then I'll just stand out here all night.

38:53.150 --> 38:54.150
Xie Qingyuan.

38:55.000 --> 38:58.360
You've always prided yourself on
being able to see through people, right?

38:58.360 --> 38:59.840
How come you can't tell

39:02.880 --> 39:04.550
that I mean you no harm?

39:08.440 --> 39:09.800
At least, not for now.

39:16.000 --> 39:16.670
Mother,

39:17.360 --> 39:19.290
what did Jingzhi say in the letter?

39:27.590 --> 39:28.630
A few days ago,

39:29.840 --> 39:31.070
I sent someone

39:31.190 --> 39:33.430
to deliver a letter to Shu,

39:34.230 --> 39:36.230
informing him of Qingyuan's return

39:37.440 --> 39:40.400
and Yan Rui's arrival in Hengtang.

39:41.150 --> 39:43.710
I asked him to look into

39:44.150 --> 39:45.880
Yan Rui's background thoroughly,

39:45.880 --> 39:46.800
so we'd know

39:47.230 --> 39:49.630
how best to deal with him in the future.

39:50.320 --> 39:52.400
This reply

39:54.030 --> 39:55.960
has certainly made things clear.

39:56.590 --> 39:57.480
Old Madam,

39:57.590 --> 39:58.480
so Master...

40:01.880 --> 40:02.960
Yan Rui

40:04.510 --> 40:06.510
is a close confidant of His Majesty,

40:06.840 --> 40:08.670
serving at His Majesty's side

40:08.760 --> 40:10.510
and enjoying

40:10.630 --> 40:12.360
His Majesty's profound favor.

40:12.480 --> 40:14.880
He has received countless lavish rewards,

40:14.920 --> 40:16.190
enjoys free access to the imperial palace,

40:16.190 --> 40:18.440
and travels with a large retinue.

40:19.070 --> 40:20.360
Everyone at court

40:20.440 --> 40:22.710
knows the extent of
his power and influence,

40:22.710 --> 40:24.400
and none dares take him lightly.

40:24.400 --> 40:26.320
Moreover, Yan Rui

40:26.670 --> 40:28.150
has amassed a considerable faction
of his own.

40:28.150 --> 40:30.710
Corruption runs rampant
among his associates.

40:30.710 --> 40:33.000
Though some officials have voiced
quiet objections,

40:33.000 --> 40:34.550
they fear his power too much

40:34.630 --> 40:36.550
to speak openly.

40:36.840 --> 40:38.840
Most keep silent or flatter him

40:39.000 --> 40:42.030
to protect themselves.

40:43.840 --> 40:46.960
So Jingzhi and Brother
can't do anything about it, either?

40:46.960 --> 40:49.440
Never mind your brother and Shu—

40:50.590 --> 40:53.250
even Shen Run,
His Majesty's trusted confidant

40:53.760 --> 40:57.000
and the Commander of the Palace Guard,

40:58.230 --> 41:00.550
submitted 18 memorials in succession

41:00.880 --> 41:02.610
and petitioned the Censorate,

41:03.000 --> 41:05.230
and all Yan Rui got for it

41:05.320 --> 41:08.450
was the cushy assignment
of overseeing disaster relief

41:08.510 --> 41:09.920
in Hengtang.

41:13.670 --> 41:14.360
Mother.

41:15.670 --> 41:17.360
Since our Qingyuan

41:18.360 --> 41:20.110
has caught Lord Yan's eye,

41:21.110 --> 41:22.030
why don't we

41:26.510 --> 41:28.240
make the best of the situation?

41:36.030 --> 41:37.690
I'm just worried that Yan Rui,

41:37.840 --> 41:39.280
who's always been reckless with women,

41:39.280 --> 41:41.630
only wants a fleeting affair.

41:41.630 --> 41:42.490
Preposterous.

41:42.880 --> 41:45.410
She's a daughter
of our Xie family, after all.

41:45.510 --> 41:47.840
How could we let him treat her
so casually?

41:58.710 --> 42:00.230
Prepare the red stationery.
